      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>350&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.125</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>atm</mi></math>",
